OL,3,GNEWSAEngland's Victorian connection to
OL,4,Athe Bayeux Tapestry
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Bayeux Tapestry's arrival in
OL,7,FEngland for the first time in 1,000
OL,8,Fyears has been welcomed by the King and
OL,9,Fprime minister, but its arrival has
OL,10,Fhelped put a new spotlight on a
OL,11,Flesser-known Victorian copy.
OL,13,FCreated in 1886 by a team of 35
OL,14,Fembroiderers in Leek, Staffordshire,
OL,15,Fthe replica has been on display in
OL,16,FBerkshire for most of its existence,
OL,17,Fand is a faithful rendition in all but
OL,18,Fjust a few details.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,333,330,200,160,0,100
